WEBVTT

00:01:29.627 --> 00:01:33.464
Being a Black male teacher
is a game changer.

00:01:33.506 --> 00:01:36.926
Being a Black male teacher
is becoming a superhero.

00:01:37.677 --> 00:01:38.928
So let's talk about him.

00:01:39.637 --> 00:01:43.516
Let's take a look at the landscape
currently in the United States.

00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:46.269
Less than three percent
of all teachers are Black men.

00:01:46.269 --> 00:01:49.272
For my liberal arts majors
that's three out of 100.

00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:51.774
(Laughs)

00:01:51.774 --> 00:01:54.861
Now, Black men are in classrooms

00:01:54.861 --> 00:01:57.155
as disciplinarians,

00:01:57.155 --> 00:01:58.948
as janitors,

00:01:58.948 --> 00:02:00.700
as intervention specialists